My apologies if you are reading this for the second time.  I posted this
about a week ago from a news site I'm not too sure about and it seemed
to just vanish.

My priest Zorachus was hot on the trail of quest nemesis Nalzok in the
priest quest.  Zorachus tried to head Nalzok off and prevent him from
escaping by teleporting right to the up staircase.  Nalzok was standing
on the stairs so Zorachus zapped him with a wand of teleport.  The first
couple of times Nalzok popped right back before Zorachus could occupy
the staircase but finally Zorachus got in there.  For the next couple of
hundred turns Zorachus laid about him with Frost Brand slaying all the
monsters Nalzok had summoned.  When the mayhem was over, Nalzok was
nowhere to be seen.  Zorachus slips on his blindfold to scan with
telepathy-- nothing.

Over the course of thousands of turns Zorachus covers every inch of the
quest level without finding Nalzok.  The high priest doesn't know
anything, praying doesn't help.  

Now Zorachus is back in the dungeon of doom.  More thousands of turns
have passed, he has explored another 6 or 7 levels.  Still no sign of
Nalzok.  

Since Nalzok still had the bell of opening when he got away, is Zorachus
out of luck?  Will Nalzok ever turn up?  Is it possible to wish for the
bell?

